    <tags>azureaccount-vscode vscode extension azureaccount azure</tags>
    <summary>A common Sign-In and Subscription management extension for VS Code.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[**This package is deprecated.** Microsoft has deprecated the Azure Account extension for Visual Studio Code, and its last release was 0.13.0 in January 2025. Microsoft names the Azure Resources extension as its replacement, which the [vscode-azureresourcegroups](https://community.chocolatey.org/packages/vscode-azureresourcegroups) package installs.

This version installs nothing itself. It depends on vscode-azureresourcegroups, so upgrading this package moves you to that package. Use vscode-azureresourcegroups directly for new installs.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>Deprecated in favour of the vscode-azureresourcegroups package, as Microsoft has deprecated the Azure Account extension in favour of Azure Resources.</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="vscode-azureresourcegroups" version="0.12.7" />
    </dependencies>
